      "question_html": "<div class=\"q-line\"><div class=\"q-line__text\">A bag contains 5 red counters and 3 blue counters. Two counters are taken at random without replacement. Work out the probability that both counters are the same colour.</div><span class=\"q-marks\">(4)</span></div>",
