      "question_html": "<p>In triangle PQR, PQ = 7 cm, PR = 9 cm and angle QPR = 52°.</p>\n<div class=\"q-part\"><span class=\"q-part__label\">(a)</span><div class=\"q-part__body\">Calculate the length of QR. Give your answer to 3 significant figures.</div><span class=\"q-marks\">(3)</span></div>\n<div class=\"q-part\"><span class=\"q-part__label\">(b)</span><div class=\"q-part__body\">Calculate the area of triangle PQR. Give your answer to 3 significant figures.</div><span class=\"q-marks\">(2)</span></div>",
      "question_image_url": null,
      "mark_scheme_html": "<div class=\"q-part\"><span class=\"q-part__label\">(a)</span><div class=\"q-part__body\">QR<sup>2</sup> = 7<sup>2</sup> + 9<sup>2</sup> − 2 × 7 × 9 × cos 52°</div><span class=\"ms-codes\">M1</span></div>\n<div class=\"q-line\"><div class=\"q-line__text\">QR<sup>2</sup> = 52.4</div><span class=\"ms-codes\">A1</span></div>\n<div class=\"q-line\"><div class=\"q-line__text\">QR = 7.24 cm</div><span class=\"ms-codes\">A1</span></div>\n<div class=\"q-part\"><span class=\"q-part__label\">(b)</span><div class=\"q-part__body\"><span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"frac__n\">1</span><span class=\"frac__d\">2</span></span> × 7 × 9 × sin 52°</div><span class=\"ms-codes\">M1</span></div>\n<div class=\"q-line\"><div class=\"q-line__text\">24.8 cm<sup>2</sup></div><span class=\"ms-codes\">A1</span></div>",
      "mark_scheme_image_url": null
    }
  },
