      "question_html": "<div class=\"q-line\"><div class=\"q-line__text\">Prove algebraically that the difference between the squares of any two consecutive odd numbers is a multiple of 8.</div><span class=\"q-marks\">(5)</span></div>",
      "question_image_url": null,
      "mark_scheme_html": "<div class=\"q-line\"><div class=\"q-line__text\">Writes two consecutive odd numbers as 2n + 1 and 2n + 3</div><span class=\"ms-codes\">B1</span></div>\n<div class=\"q-line\"><div class=\"q-line__text\">(2n + 3)<sup>2</sup> − (2n + 1)<sup>2</sup></div><span class=\"ms-codes\">M1</span></div>\n<div class=\"q-line\"><div class=\"q-line__text\">4n<sup>2</sup> + 12n + 9 − 4n<sup>2</sup> − 4n − 1</div><span class=\"ms-codes\">M1</span></div>\n<div class=\"q-line\"><div class=\"q-line__text\">8n + 8</div><span class=\"ms-codes\">A1</span></div>\n<div class=\"q-line\"><div class=\"q-line__text\">= 8(n + 1), which is a multiple of 8</div><span class=\"ms-codes\">A1</span></div>",
      "mark_scheme_image_url": null
    }
  },
