      "question_html": "<p>The functions f and g are such that f(x) = 3x − 2 and g(x) = x<sup>2</sup> + 1.</p>\n<div class=\"q-part\"><span class=\"q-part__label\">(a)</span><div class=\"q-part__body\">Find fg(2).</div><span class=\"q-marks\">(2)</span></div>\n<div class=\"q-part\"><span class=\"q-part__label\">(b)</span><div class=\"q-part__body\">Find f<sup>−1</sup>(x).</div><span class=\"q-marks\">(2)</span></div>\n<div class=\"q-part\"><span class=\"q-part__label\">(c)</span><div class=\"q-part__body\">Solve gf(x) = 26.</div><span class=\"q-marks\">(3)</span></div>",
      "question_image_url": null,
      "mark_scheme_html": "<div class=\"q-part\"><span class=\"q-part__label\">(a)</span><div class=\"q-part__body\">g(2) = 5</div><span class=\"ms-codes\">M1</span></div>\n<div class=\"q-line\"><div class=\"q-line__text\">fg(2) = 13</div><span class=\"ms-codes\">A1</span></div>\n<div class=\"q-part\"><span class=\"q-part__label\">(b)</span><div class=\"q-part__body\">y = 3x − 2, so x = <span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"frac__n\">y + 2</span><span class=\"frac__d\">3</span></span></div><span class=\"ms-codes\">M1</span></div>\n<div class=\"q-line\"><div class=\"q-line__text\">f<sup>−1</sup>(x) = <span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"frac__n\">x + 2</span><span class=\"frac__d\">3</span></span></div><span class=\"ms-codes\">A1</span></div>\n<div class=\"q-part\"><span class=\"q-part__label\">(c)</span><div class=\"q-part__body\">(3x − 2)<sup>2</sup> + 1 = 26</div><span class=\"ms-codes\">M1</span></div>\n<div class=\"q-line\"><div class=\"q-line__text\">3x − 2 = 5 or 3x − 2 = −5</div><span class=\"ms-codes\">M1</span></div>\n<div class=\"q-line\"><div class=\"q-line__text\">x = <span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"frac__n\">7</span><span class=\"frac__d\">3</span></span> or x = −1</div><span class=\"ms-codes\">A1</span></div>",
      "mark_scheme_image_url": null
    }
  },
